      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Hello! As an update, I went to bed and woke up and the avatars uploaded when I checked again on my Android phone.\n\nSo they simply were delayed by more than 2 hours before they uploaded properly on Android (a behavior I had not seen before, usually avatar uploads take a matter of minutes).\n\nThe avatar IDs that were affected by this were: \n\navtr_7db952eb-cdb4-4bf1-aef5-9ac60d4dcae9\n\navtr_7f6fcd29-4f50-4ff4-a7ad-c2c90745dfab\n\navtr_5aff9f17-996d-43a0-9650-1e9b4707d587\n\nAnd I was uploading with SDK 3.10.6 .",
