      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} I have another update. I am on my Android phone again to check on the avatars and they have reverted back the previous build again \n\n(I made large changes to the hair and matcap on the pants on Android so it is very apparent that it is the previous build). \n\nThese avatars are also previewing correctly in the window but then when I swap to them, they revert to the previous build.\n\nI suspect this has something to do with either the cache on my phone (saving the previous avatar) or some kind of conflict where the avatars are stored in VRChat's system so the avatars are being retrieved incorrectly.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
