  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Description\n\nI have recently updated several avatars on both PC and on Android. After over an hour and confirming the avatars are properly being linked to the PC versions, the Android versions are not updating in the client and on Android mobile. The avatars on mobile are \"stuck\" in the old version but they preview correctly as the new version. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nTo replicate: Update an avatar using Unity on PC. Then, update the Android versions. The Android avatars will stay as the old version. When you check them in the mobile client and swap quickly, they will not load as the newest version of the avatar.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Sometimes\n\n---\n\nplatform: AndroidMobile (platform: Android - Mobile, store: PlayStore, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-05_04-06-45.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_1961b5b5-e218-4608-9392-f2ccd8635c0a/1/file)",
